Touching this file starts .github/workflows/raw-tape-archive.yml, which copies
every surviving raw pmus_ws_* part out of the recorder volume's rolling 12 GiB
retention, verifies each archived copy byte-for-byte against the sha256 of the
uncompressed original, and fails if any listed part is missing.

The workflow reads no directive from this file -- the part list is built from a
listing taken inside the run, because retention moves while we work. Only the
counter below changes, to start a run.

